panels.description:
Every DS18B20 the board has ever reported. A sensor appears automatically the first time it is seen, with no zone name, and shows a live temperature straight away. That is how you identify one: warm the sensor you just fitted, watch which row moves, then give it a name with

  UPDATE sensor SET zone_label='freezer' WHERE rom_code='...';

Naming it relabels its entire history, not just readings from that moment on. The HTTP endpoint that does this from a browser arrives at stage D4.
